su name thumbnail heading burn from filename image with text heading to filename output be ceremony def
  exists su name cmd ob text "node command/thumbnail_heading_burn.mjs" be text ya
  ob text " \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob filename of from of this to name text image path be text do
  ob name image path to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text " \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob filename of to of this to name text output path be text do
  ob name output path to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text " --text-stdin --y-ratio 0.20 --max-width-ratio 0.82" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text of cmd fromtext text of with of this be command do
  su name result ret
prah

su name thumbnail heading burn from filename image with name text heading to filename output be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this with text of ob of with of this to filename of to of this be thumbnail heading burn do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name thumbnail heading burn be export ya
